:{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:06:12Z","email":"xquinhox@gmail.com","name":"Marcos-Toledo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T15:06:12Z","email":"xquinhox@gmail.com","name":"Marcos-Toledo"},"message":"fix(ds): base.css compartilhado para MFE standalone identico ao federado\n\nO standalone dos MFEs (:5001/:5002) aparecia sem estilo: tokens.css so\ndefine custom properties — resets, font-family e fundo viviam no\nLayout do shell. Novo base.css no design-tokens carrega essa base;\nmain.tsx e mount.tsx dos MFEs importam os dois, entao o remote fica\nauto-suficiente (CSS viaja com o bundle federado) e identico standalone.\n\nTambem corrige o typecheck do shell, quebrado pelo upgrade do mobile:\ncom @types/react@18 (web) e @19 (mobile) no workspace, o pnpm hoistou\na 19 em .pnpm/node_modules e os d.ts do react-router resolviam ''react''\npara ela. paths no tsconfig do shell fixa a resolucao na copia local.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"2122e5d476fda7af36629e21e59e08a2137e6497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcos-Toledo/portal-pessoas-poc/git/trees/2122e5d476fda7af36629e21e59e08a2137e6497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcos-Toledo/portal-pessoas-poc/git/commits/36653442324809d1bbd4e810c47ff5f9f9a91d61","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13186981?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Marcos-Toledo","id":13186981,"login":"Marcos-Toledo","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTg2OTgx","organiz