/api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcos-Toledo/portal-pessoas-poc/commits/be84246dc9904bdbe5cf2ceb7110b6975287a789/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:49:19Z","email":"xquinhox@gmail.com","name":"Marcos-Toledo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T14:56:30Z","email":"xquinhox@gmail.com","name":"Marcos-Toledo"},"message":"fix(mfe): react-dom fora do shared da federacao (entry standalone)\n\nO entry standalone (main.tsx) dos MFEs quebrava com\n\"Cannot set properties of undefined (setting ''usingClientEntryPoint'')\":\no proxy de share do @module-federation/vite resolve react-dom/client\npara um chunk otimizado cujo __SECRET_INTERNALS vem indefinido, de\nforma instavel entre otimizacoes de deps.\n\nCada remote agora embute sua propria copia de react-dom; react segue\nsingleton compartilhado (e o que importa para dispatcher de hooks e\ncontext). O shell nunca exercitava esse caminho (consome apenas o\n./mount exposto), por isso o bug so aparecia acessando :5001/:5002.\n\nGenerated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"466426552674271f1dbb5cb4b5067d790d718a24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcos-Toledo/portal-pessoas-poc/git/trees/466426552674271f1dbb5cb4b5067d790d718a24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Marcos-Toledo/portal-pessoas-poc/git/commits/be84246dc9904bdbe5cf2ceb7110b6975287a789","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13186981?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcos-Toledo/followi