"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T22:48:57Z","email":"jcsantamar@gmail.com","name":"Juan"},"message":"Phase 2: Complete backend cleanup + onboarding polish\n\n## Backend cleanup\n- Remove Casting, Round, Submission, Participant, Director models\n- Add Item model with full CRUD use cases\n- Redesign Bitacora with entityType/entityId/metadata\n- Adapt User entity (remove _submissions)\n- Rename videoUpload -> demoFileUpload\n- Rename /videos/:key/url -> /files/:key/url\n- Rewrite routes (add /items, remove domain routes)\n- Rewrite seed (generic users: admin/user/guest + items demo)\n- Keep EventQueue, Bitacora, ADMIT_TOKENS, R2, email\n- Remove domain-specific tests\n\n## Onboarding polish\n- setup.sh copies .env.example to .env (backend, frontend, orchestration, tests/REST Client)\n- prisma.config.ts throws clear error if DATABASE_URL is missing\n- README Quick Start updated with full flow\n- Change PostgreSQL port to 5433 (host) to avoid conflicts\n\n## Technical debt\n- Remove typecheck scripts (they hid real state)\n- Document typecheck behavior in AGENTS.md\n- Create docu/FINDINGS.md as technical debt registry\n- Note base error count (~127) to track regressions\n\n## Verification\n- setup.sh works end-to-end in /tmp\n- prisma db push + seed works\n- Backend starts with tsx\n- API responds: health, login, items CRUD, config, bitacora\n- 0 castant references in src/","tree":{"sha":"d6062fb3b4f5bbba35878006156a80814716f1dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jc365/fullstack-events-starter/git/trees/d6062fb3b4f5bbba35878006156a80814716f1dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jc365/fullstack-events-starter/git/commits/ae387a518040f6cab1a76337db8bd8520dbebc10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35151037?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jc365/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jc365/follo