outte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aboutte","id":4643742,"login":"aboutte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDM3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/757aec3ec54e8bf9dd316a61182192161307f487/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:29:37Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T00:29:37Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"message":"chore: bump devkit mongo from 6.0 to 7.0.14\n\nMongoDB 6.0 reached end of life on 2025-07-31. Move the dev kit off the\nEOL line and onto 7.0.14, matching the version the helpdesk-helm chart\nalready pins, so local and deployed environments run the same server.\n\n7.0 is supported until 2027-08-31.\n\nVerified that an existing 6.0 volume upgrades in place with no migration\nstep: started mongo:6.0 (FCV 6.0), wrote data, then started mongo:7.0.14\nagainst the same volume. It came up healthy, all data read back intact,\nand reads and writes both worked. The startup log is clean, reporting\nonly the informational \"current featureCompatibilityVersion: 6.0\" line.\nFCV stays at 6.0, which is the supported steady state — 7.0-only on-disk\nfeatures stay dormant, and nothing in the dev kit depends on them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbdbba8773ac27a43a5e854cf62af8101fbfff61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/dbdbba8773ac27a43a5e854cf62af8101fbfff61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/757aec3ec54e8bf9dd316a61182192161307f487","verification":{"payload":"tree dbdbba8773ac27a43a5e854cf62af8101fbfff61\nparent f2538bf006262e2de2e10f684da5b49bd959a8eb\nauthor Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790555377 -0700\ncommitter Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790555377 -0700\n\nchore: bump devkit mongo from 6.0 to 7.0.14\n\nMongoDB 6.0 reached end of life on 2025-07-31. Move the dev kit off the\nEOL line and onto 7.0.14, matching the version the helpdesk-helm chart\nalready pins, so local and deployed environments run the same server.\n\n7.0 is supported until 2027-08-31.\n\nVerified that an existing 6.0 volume upgrades in place with no migration\nstep: started mongo:6.0 (FCV 6.0), wrote data, then started mongo:7.0.14\nagainst the same volume. It came up healthy, all data read back intact,\nand reads and writes both worked. The startup log is clean, reporting\nonly the informational \"current featureCompatibilityVersion: 6.0\" line.\nFCV stays at 6.0, which is the supported steady state — 7.0-only on-disk\nfeatures stay dormant, and nothing in the dev kit depends on them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAPiLwERkyNXZ7qXP5Q/Wim\nVODBOhNGOT7sm4PUb2P8dIURvqxcPmCbXFxeqGAV48cdWBkMpsF+xPYzQyUDdzASnI5XP0\nLm13grakx7UnqMgxS1FG0sI/Sq0I2eUyE9GOrXM4EozpM0Q1zCpNKzp97ac4Q9a5V0M08Q\nd2zFyw4L/4NFP/uMdtfGTHEEXqjtMD5dV27pZl+8Fi28ViYHkqMcpKPbqrH2XAEHDsEBjC\n0oKZxttXTPqWMImA+/CAMVVYu3+HW4YEaedGZm/cpZ5oGtQzdn9NKtszTAxgfFPR35Ne1B\nXxmsr0lEwjth8bIPsoA2Uv2y3OGhGOVi1jWnwYKwSZuJxsk1mOOwGj6mZtpYv9a5IZhXJc\nCkk0ftfHzK9Ur9CH/FoBsmpJsArCKEyQBiZNP8Sl9eK/PUim0INcvzb36hBtxHLhDPgeVx\nm12UxATPiHSu2kwbhp9/GtftmCOST518ohdSKKsaOOnloK07ieeD5XnTpeZT97dhwSf4oa\nCv60v8lhH3QSLoHsejSZvxI+f/vOk2I5MvVHRC+8x+Twd4R6nzkzFkcn3AubIwcUcIfi6x\ntCUwUxxwpC2BCELp/onMzNNmDS11+YHdBBb0ntQNU75pJt1eWdMmaeJ/RokcDPO