eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/b498b6edf385ed4e7871499a88292765cd7a2af7","node_id":"C_kwDOUi6i8toAKGI0OThiNmVkZjM4NWVkNGU3ODcxNDk5YTg4MjkyNzY1Y2Q3YTJhZjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/2107e5cd031b56218ede198a4c907f2380123313","sha":"2107e5cd031b56218ede198a4c907f2380123313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/2107e5cd031b56218ede198a4c907f2380123313"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/31fc3ccf4a4331059387d353d447e94163d1814e","sha":"31fc3ccf4a4331059387d353d447e94163d1814e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/31fc3ccf4a4331059387d353d447e94163d1814e"}],"sha":"b498b6edf385ed4e7871499a88292765cd7a2af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/b498b6edf385ed4e7871499a88292765cd7a2af7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4643742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aboutte","id":4643742,"login":"aboutte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDM3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/31fc3ccf4a4331059387d353d447e94163d1814e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:25:43Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T22:25:43Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"message":"feat(scripts): default to Sonnet 5 and offer Opus 5.5 in the LLM picker\n\n- run.sh / scripts/switch-llm.sh now provision Claude Sonnet 5\n  (claude-sonnet-5 direct Anthropic, us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5 either\n  Bedrock mode) as CLAUDE_MODEL, and add the matching Opus 5.5 id via a\n  new comma-separated CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS env var.\n- scripts/register-llm.sh registers every id in CLAUDE_MODEL +\n  CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS and makes the System LLM mapping exactly that set,\n  with CLAUDE_MODEL as the default — so the ticket LLM picker offers\n  Sonnet 5 (default) and Opus 5.5 side by side. The model-list build is\n  bash 3.2 safe (macOS system bash) on every argument shape: blank\n  CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS, a single positional id, several positional ids,\n  and two ids from .env.\n- Gateway provider stays single-model (gateway model names are\n  provider-specific) and its default moves to claude-sonnet-5.\n- The subscription provider (merged from dev/#1) gets the same\n  treatment: SUBSCRIPTION_DEFAULT_MODEL moves to claude-sonnet-5, and\n  provider_subscription_configure clears CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS for the\n  same reason it already rejects a carried-over us.anthropic.* /\n  gateway-namespaced CLAUDE_MODEL — the first-party API rejects those\n  ids on either field.\n- Swept the retired claude-sonnet-4-6 / anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6 ids\n  out of scripts, docker-compose.yml fallback, .env.example, docs, and\n  tests — no retired id remains in the repo outside hackday/''s\n  third-party OpenRouter examples.\n\nTesting: all 5 suites pass, 58 checks — test-provider-gateway.sh 16/16,\ntest-provider-subscription.sh 15/15, test-run-gateway-wiring.sh 9/9,\ntest-run-subscription-wiring.sh 11/11, test-switch-llm-subscription.sh\n7/7. docker compose config validates; bash -n clean on every touched\nscript; ./run.sh --help renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"00a50bddf71fe5c41a68e578da52298df4a35ebf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/00a50bddf71fe5c41a68e578da52298df4a35ebf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/31fc3ccf4a4331059387d353d447e94163d1814e","verification":{"payload":"tree 00a50bddf71fe5c41a68e578da52298df4a35ebf\nparent 2107e5cd031b56218ede198a4c907f2380123313\nauthor Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790547943 -0700\ncommitter Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790547943 -0700\n\nfeat(scripts): default to Sonnet 5 and offer Opus 5.5 in the LLM picker\n\n- run.sh / scripts/switch-llm.sh now provision Claude Sonnet 5\n  (claude-sonnet-5 direct Anthropic, us.anthropic.claude-sonnet-5 either\n  Bedrock mode) as CLAUDE_MODEL, and add the matching Opus 5.5 id via a\n  new comma-separated CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS env var.\n- scripts/register-llm.sh registers every id in CLAUDE_MODEL +\n  CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS and makes the System LLM mapping exactly that set,\n  with CLAUDE_MODEL as the default — so the ticket LLM picker offers\n  Sonnet 5 (default) and Opus 5.5 side by side. The model-list build is\n  bash 3.2 safe (macOS system bash) on every argument shape: blank\n  CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS, a single positional id, several positional ids,\n  and two ids from .env.\n- Gateway provider stays single-model (gateway model names are\n  provider-specific) and its default moves to claude-sonnet-5.\n- The subscription provider (merged from dev/#1) gets the same\n  treatment: SUBSCRIPTION_DEFAULT_MODEL moves to claude-sonnet-5, and\n  provider_subscription_configure clears CLAUDE_EXTRA_MODELS for the\n  same reason it already rejects a carried-over us.anthropic.* /\n  gateway-namespaced CLAUDE_MODEL — the first-party API rejects those\n  ids on either field.\n- Swept the retired claude-sonnet-4-6 / anthropic/claude-sonnet-4.6 ids\n  out of scripts, docker-compose.yml fallback, .env.example, docs, and\n  tests — no retired id remains in the repo outside hackday/''s\n  third-party OpenRouter examples.\n\nTesting: all 5 suites pass, 58 checks — test-provider-gateway.sh 16/16,\ntest-provider-subscription.sh 15/15, test-run-gateway-wiring.sh 9/9,\ntest-run-subscription-wiring.sh 11/11, test-switch-llm-subscription.sh\n7/7. docker compose config validates; bash -n clean on every touched\nscript; ./run.sh --help renders.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAPiLwERkyNXZ7qXP5Q/Wim\nVODBOhNGOT7sm4PUb2P8dIURvqxcPmCbXFxeqGAV48cdWBkMpsF+xPYzQyUDdzASnI5XP0\nLm13grakx7UnqMgxS1FG0sI/Sq0I2eUyE9GOrXM4EozpM0Q1zCpNKzp97ac4Q9a5V0M08Q\nd2zFyw4L/4NFP/uMdtfGTHEEXqjtMD5dV27pZl+8Fi28ViYHkqMcpKPbqrH2XAEHDsEBjC\n0oKZxttXTPqWMImA+/CAMVVYu3+HW4YEaedGZm/cpZ5oGtQzdn9NKtszTAxgfFPR35Ne1B\nXxmsr0lEwjth8bIPsoA2Uv2y3OGhGOVi1jWnwYKwSZuJxsk1mOOwGj6mZtpYv9a5IZhXJc\nCkk0ftfHzK9Ur9CH/FoBsmpJsArCKEyQBiZNP8Sl9eK/PUim0INcvzb36hBtxHLhDPgeVx\nm12UxATPiHSu2kwbhp9/GtftmCOST518ohdSKKsaOOnloK07ieeD5XnTpeZT97dhwSf4oa\nCv60v8lhH3QSLoHsejSZvxI+f/vOk2I5MvVHRC+8x+Twd4R6nzkzFkcn3AubIwcUcIfi6x\ntCUwUxxwpC2BCELp/onMzNNmDS11+YHdBBb0ntQNU75pJt1eWdMmaeJ/RokcDPOCjf30rZ\ndnYS041Xz44g+CQGV61w28hRirlxdRl3AAAAA2dpdAAAAAAAAAAGc2hhNTEyAAACFAAAAA\nxyc2Etc2hhMi0yNTYAAAIAuTQM0ercUXDzqMYg7WshTJDWXXkkKsp7g5ILv2Z74k7B+I7P\nOAD/wHHjLVma5R82B/6t3kSfSu+mQ3QA5b3/6XC5vXy6sIKKvtWnw7BDs2gosNpHt6k2k8\nWjqo9KAnjILkJs1DclN+72ICKlq8pzeAb7YeCYHy6RL1f/PpeKi7hFoV3slXCuKTTwWbid\nmgLsH8l+0FQ8W8r0oMDbXyMuwRRblgDvDFE4U0oCNj2AHxvgESTJY0HUlNagd0bGlir1V3\nAwzANgGp2x