ar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4643742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aboutte","id":4643742,"login":"aboutte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDM3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/40c852c9a517bfcf8d9fc6a3b0507531b057be5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:33:45Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:33:45Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"message":"fix(scripts): include .agents in upgrade_dev_kit.sh framework dirs\n\n.agents/skills -> ../.claude/skills (the Codex skills symlink added for\nGitHub Copilot/Codex support) was missing from FRAMEWORK_DIRS, so\nupgrade_dev_kit.sh silently skipped it on every already-adopted repo.\nFresh clones got the symlink from git directly; upgrades never did.\n\nVerified against a simulated pre-PR adopter repo: the unpatched script\nexits 0 and reports \"Framework upgraded\" without ever creating\n.agents. With this fix it rsyncs the symlink in on the next upgrade\nrun (the very first upgrade after this lands will still miss it once,\nsince scripts/ itself only updates that same run — a second run picks\nit up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6d17645cfcf824dc4c477a67bd6da7c7995a1ce9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/6d17645cfcf824dc4c477a67bd6da7c7995a1ce9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/40c852c9a517bfcf8d9fc6a3b0507531b057be5b","verification":{"payload":"tree 6d17645cfcf824dc4c477a67bd6da7c7995a1ce9\nparent cd356a6c13cf04489dbfc92be480c56b2ac49c48\nauthor Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790127225 -0500\ncommitter Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790127225 -0500\n\nfix(scripts): include .agents in upgrade_dev_kit.sh framework dirs\n\n.agents/skills -> ../.claude/skills (the Codex skills symlink added for\nGitHub Copilot/Codex support) was missing from FRAMEWORK_DIRS, so\nupgrade_dev_kit.sh silently skipped it on every already-adopted repo.\nFresh clones got the symlink from git directly; upgrades never did.\n\nVerified against a simulated pre-PR adopter repo: the unpatched script\nexits 0 and reports \"Framework upgraded\" without ever creating\n.agents. With this fix it rsyncs the symlink in on the next upgrade\nrun (the very first upgrade after this lands will still miss it once,\nsince scripts/ itself only updates that same run — a second run picks\nit up).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAPiLwERkyNXZ7qXP5Q/Wim\nVODBOhNGOT7sm4PUb2P8dIURvqxcPmCbXFxeqGAV48cdWBkMpsF+xPYzQyUDdzASnI5XP0\nLm13grakx7UnqMgxS1FG0sI/Sq0I2eUyE9GOrXM4EozpM0Q1zCpNKzp97ac4Q9a5V0M08Q\nd2zFyw4L/4NFP/uMdtfGTHEEXqjtMD5dV27pZl+8Fi28ViYHkqMcpKPbqrH2XAEHDsEBjC\n0oKZxttXTPqWMImA+/CAMVVYu3+HW4YEaedGZm/cpZ5oGtQzdn9NKtszTAxgfFPR35Ne1B\nXxmsr0lEwjth8bIPsoA2Uv2y3OGhGOVi1jWnwYKwSZuJxsk1mOOwGj6mZtpYv9a5IZhXJc\nCkk0ftfHzK9Ur9CH/FoBsmpJsArCKEyQBiZNP8Sl9eK/PUim0INcvzb36hBtxHLhDPgeVx\nm12UxATPiHSu2kwbhp9/GtftmCOST518ohdSKKsaOOnloK07ieeD5XnTpeZT97dhwSf4oa\nCv60v8lhH3QSLoHsejSZvxI+f/vOk2I5MvVHRC+8x