events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/a5ba6e18063ed577ca4eaffc7629024fda7c125f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T18:38:55Z","email":"niranjan@duplocloud.net","name":"niranjan-duplocloud"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T21:42:04Z","email":"niranjan@duplocloud.net","name":"niranjan-duplocloud"},"message":"feat(agent-skills): add Codex skills symlink","tree":{"sha":"9fe013dff736eccde3b64044790c77b94df4b4d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/9fe013dff736eccde3b64044790c77b94df4b4d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/a5ba6e18063ed577ca4eaffc7629024fda7c125f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288114110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/niranjan-duplocloud","id":288114110,"login":"niranjan-duplocloud","node_id":"U_kgDOESxFvg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/niranjan-duplocloud","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/a5ba6e18063ed577ca4eaffc7629024fda7c125f","node_id":"C_kwDOUi6i8toAKGE1YmE2ZTE4MDYzZWQ1NzdjYTRlYWZmYzc2MjkwMjRmZGE3YzEyNWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/71850dffc0aaa92c32e99eff1de4451e82f963d6","sha":"71850dffc0aaa92c32e99eff1de4451e82f963d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/71850dffc0aaa92c32e99eff1de4451e82f963d6"}],"sha":"a5ba6e18063ed577ca4eaffc7629024fda7c125f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/a5ba6e18063ed577ca4eaffc7629024fda7c125f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4643742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aboutte","id":4643742,"login":"aboutte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDM3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/bfc0d72e4186776521a679a6c0f5d281615239c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:22:28Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:22:28Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"message":"fix(run): surface studio API errors instead of a JSON traceback\n\nThe three create calls in run.sh piped `curl -fsS ... | python3\njson.load(sys.stdin)[\"data\"][\"id\"]`. On a 4xx, -f makes curl print\nnothing, so the studio''s explanation was discarded and the run ended\nwith a bare `curl: (22) ... 400` plus a JSONDecodeError traceback from\npython reading empty stdin.\n\nAdd scripts/_studio_api.sh with studio_create_id, which keeps the\nresponse body, prints the server''s message/errors on stderr (tagged\nwith the error code, e.g. license_limit_exceeded) and returns\nnon-zero. An expired license now reports \"This DuploCloud AI Studio\ninstance''s license has expired...\" instead of a traceback.\n\nThe workspace create is fatal since everything after it depends on the\nid; the permission set and group creates warn and continue, as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a685d6aced6d81384832d9f5783c3a54a5a4417","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/4a685d6aced6d81384832d9f5783c3a54a5a4417"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/bfc0d72e4186776521a679a6c0f5d281615239c9","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a685d6aced6d81384832d9f5783c3a54a5a4417\nparent f2538bf006262e2de2e10f684da5b49bd959a8eb\nauthor Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790104948 -0500\ncommitter Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1790104948 -0500\n\nfix(run): surface studio API errors instead of a JSON traceback\n\nThe three create calls in run.sh piped `curl -fsS ... | python3\njson.load(sys.stdin)[\"data\"][\"id\"]`. On a 4xx, -f makes curl print\nnothing, so the studio''s explanation was discarded and the run ended\nwith a bare `curl: (22) ... 400` plus a JSONDecodeError traceback from\npython reading empty stdin.\n\nAdd scripts/_studio_api.sh with studio_create_id, which keeps the\nresponse body, prints the server''s message/errors on stderr (tagged\nwith the error code, e.g. license_limit_exceeded) and returns\nnon-zero. An expired license now reports \"This DuploCloud AI Studio\ninstance''s license has expired...\" instead of a traceback.\n\nThe workspace create is fatal since everything after it depends on the\nid; the permission set and group creates warn and continue, as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAPiLwERkyNXZ7qXP5Q/Wim\nVODBOhNGOT7sm4PUb2P8dIURvqxcPmCbXFxeqGAV48cdWBkMpsF+xPYzQyUDdzASnI5XP0\nLm13grakx7UnqMgxS1FG0sI/Sq0I2eUyE9GOrXM4EozpM0Q1zCpNKzp97ac4Q9a5V0M08Q\nd2zFyw4L/4NFP/uMdtfGTHEEXqjtMD5dV27pZl+8Fi28ViYHkqMcpKPbqrH2XAEHDsEBjC\n0oKZxttXTPqWMImA+/CAMVVYu3+HW4YEaedGZm/cpZ5oGtQzdn9NKtszTAxgfFPR35Ne1B\nXxmsr0lEwjth8bIPsoA2Uv2y3OGhGOVi1jWnwYKwSZuJxsk1mOOwGj6mZtpYv9a5IZhXJc\nCkk0ftfHzK9Ur9CH/FoBsmpJsArCKEyQBiZNP8Sl9eK/PUim0INcvzb36hBtxHLhDPgeVx\nm12UxATPiHSu2kwbhp9/GtftmCOST518ohdSKKsaOOnloK07ieeD5XnTpeZT97dhwSf4oa\nCv60v8lhH3QSLoHsejSZvxI+f/vOk2I5MvVHRC+8x+Twd4R6nzkzFkcn3AubIwcUcIfi6x\ntCUwUxxwpC2BCELp/onMzNNmDS11+YHdBBb0ntQNU75pJt1eWdMmaeJ/RokcDPOCjf30rZ\ndnYS041Xz44g+CQGV61w28hRirlxdRl3AAAAA2dpdAAAAAAAAAAGc2hhNTEyAAACFAAAAA\nxyc2Etc2hhMi0yNTYAAAIA76X/OZsnsTsBDnZ8N47zCOnt6aZaOe8fOZ2XHU9cQgRIOs69\nfVsvTaN744skrMBTodIxtZChzPEuP3NWkI/IuFhsc+fzbgkiMKHTd+DXvYpiV1oWddzaXc\nYij+XmromEaj0U5xUOi6u1p9UzLfkCePyofB0zAurK16CaTUPKLtraP7wquTy/WteVVZ+o\n9++GLrG+zz1tk37AeS9HbVzmIwZc3bGPG4O+Nl/4owae0qEKZOVYMatcgdW2edxbZCMaK/\n3xWErgfkG8PuYcEHm18WjjXheL8G2AzTuoJ+f/jMSmBS9wIVSuxpObyQQ6jcmhIl1lCAAv\nSzutDyBSF5GYTQL07i3agaxqPwP8F/tHXjkLKnf/vhxd0z5L3lI5jV1vJIvKdP8TYauYz3\nB1RRMUmZKsWraeK3sBiaSUqzlYAxCpPPYiZsQ+ipMo3fRMou++T7AN6n2TmEys6K5Odu1x\nZidZiD3bbs2vaCsZgWXoWtXLjfB9WMQdGqLyELYmJo01qYzVZfRmyQFqx14nXruda/NvFG\nxIm7RRbCn3ft8nvUUq90T2XUJf0lttT3t1TJxv5XC0UJmrS/L21sX4C9SD4L8lVNMxK9WM\nqB4wsp3glrAdAg+