it/commit/b62474d7745a958ae4ab25a97cb2f879ccb6f913","node_id":"C_kwDOUi6i8toAKGI2MjQ3NGQ3NzQ1YTk1OGFlNGFiMjVhOTdjYjJmODc5Y2NiNmY5MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/19e82c1f1602d20825387219cb6914c4eb5138c6","sha":"19e82c1f1602d20825387219cb6914c4eb5138c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/19e82c1f1602d20825387219cb6914c4eb5138c6"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/duplocloud/devkit/commit/43746008f26784f0d82a2d41de32b2a63ba1d8f3","sha":"43746008f26784f0d82a2d41de32b2a63ba1d8f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/43746008f26784f0d82a2d41de32b2a63ba1d8f3"}],"sha":"b62474d7745a958ae4ab25a97cb2f879ccb6f913","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/b62474d7745a958ae4ab25a97cb2f879ccb6f913"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4643742?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aboutte","id":4643742,"login":"aboutte","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NDM3NDI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aboutte","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/commits/43746008f26784f0d82a2d41de32b2a63ba1d8f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:15:29Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:15:29Z","email":"andy@duplocloud.net","name":"Andy Boutte"},"message":"feat(scripts): add switch-llm.sh to swap LLM provider without --reset\n\nAdds scripts/switch-llm.sh: switches the running dev-kit agent between\nanthropic / bedrock / bedrock-instance-role / gateway in place — no DB\nwipe, no re-licensing. Stashes the outgoing provider''s credentials in\n.env as _STASH_<KEY>= (restored automatically on switching back),\nblanks the live keys since the agent picks provider by precedence,\nrecreates the claude-code-agent container, and re-registers the model\nvia register-llm.sh. Adds a ''status'' subcommand.\n\n- run.sh: --reset now also clears leftover _STASH_* keys; header\n  points to switch-llm.sh for in-place provider switching.\n- docs/cli-reference.md: document the new script.\n- hackday/Sponsor Integrations.md: OpenRouter section now confirms the\n  preset via curl before re-pointing the agent, and calls out\n  switch-llm.sh for anyone who already ran ./run.sh with\n  anthropic/bedrock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51d6ed735439fc64715128e6c804ed2a3aa9ad8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/trees/51d6ed735439fc64715128e6c804ed2a3aa9ad8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/duplocloud/devkit/git/commits/43746008f26784f0d82a2d41de32b2a63ba1d8f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 51d6ed735439fc64715128e6c804ed2a3aa9ad8d\nparent 485efabf08ea81384b9673515539789325a6c290\nauthor Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1789877729 -0500\ncommitter Andy Boutte <andy@duplocloud.net> 1789877729 -0500\n\nfeat(scripts): add switch-llm.sh to swap LLM provider without --reset\n\nAdds scripts/switch-llm.sh: switches the running dev-kit agent between\nanthropic / bedrock / bedrock-instance-role / gateway in place — no DB\nwipe, no re-licensing. Stashes the outgoing provider''s credentials in\n.env as _STASH_<KEY>= (restored automatically on switching back),\nblanks the live keys since the agent picks provider by precedence,\nrecreates the claude-code-agent container, and re-registers the model\nvia register-llm.sh. Adds a ''status'' subcommand.\n\n- run.sh: --reset now also clears leftover _STASH_* keys; header\n  points to switch-llm.sh for in-place provider switching.\n- docs/cli-reference.md: document the new script.\n- hackday/Sponsor Integrations.md: OpenRouter section now confirms the\n  preset via curl before re-pointing the agent, and calls out\n  switch-llm.sh for anyone who already ran ./run.sh with\n  anthropic/bedrock.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAAhcAAAAHc3NoLXJzYQAAAAMBAAEAAAIBAPiLwERkyNXZ7qXP5Q/Wim\nVODBOhNGOT7sm4PUb2P8dIURvqxcPmCbXFxeqGAV48cdWBkMpsF+xPYzQyUDdzASnI5XP0\nLm13grakx7UnqMgxS1FG0sI/Sq0I2eUyE9GOrXM4EozpM0Q1zCpNKzp97ac4Q9a5V0M08Q\nd2zFyw4L/4NFP/uMdtfGTHEEXqjtMD5dV27pZl+8Fi28ViYHkqMcpKPbqrH2XAEHDsEBjC\n0oKZxttXTPqWMImA+/CAMVVYu3+HW4YEaedGZm/cpZ5oGtQzdn9NKtszTAxgfFPR35Ne1B\nXxmsr0lEwjth8bIPsoA2Uv2y3OGhGOVi1jWnwYKwSZuJxsk1mOOwGj6mZtpYv9a5IZhXJc\nCkk0ftfHzK9Ur9CH/FoBsmpJsArCKEyQBiZNP8Sl9eK/PUim0INcvzb36hBtxHLhDPgeVx\nm12UxATPiHSu2kwbhp9/GtftmCOST518ohdSKKsaOOnloK07ieeD5XnTpeZT97dhwSf4oa\nCv60v8lhH3QSLoHsejSZvxI+f/vOk2I5MvVHRC+8x+Twd4R6nzkzFkcn3AubIwcUcIfi6x\ntCUwUxxwpC2BCELp/onMzNNmDS11+YHdBBb0ntQNU75pJt1eWdMmaeJ/RokcDPOCjf30rZ\ndnYS041Xz44g+CQGV61w28hRirlxdRl3AAAAA2dpdAAAAAAAAAAGc2hhNTEyAAACFAAAAA\nxyc2Etc2hhMi0yNTYAAAIArd5UjWjewKYRyWF0IJlbwVpv494Ub12vvUIUOIlfe6ibl/Z8\nEmlR26XkyIJxI79X78cDv74Xqs29PrwtdKW2+UXzBEPvEk/wRZrBU/tn/gsiBsrZYjn775\nZmuT5e7ggFeQuzOxp8ZOwYf9a7x6xno6dHrt5X9r7+ulhgRlMn1GoYuvqzlrYNmVl+Mgrj\nUaV6HM8r+dsJl132ijohF3ADqX/7bOJPaHH6y/C7q1yfdA21BhSz2WegNnX+mm0Owc17Xm\nLe7fnlZZJTl9BacVhxrcnrp5ZDljThnHLpYZauQa397foX2lFU3wkzR2fyjvFwuol7Vy7h\nLDksuFjO7fnZK8Akb4pMbATRR2U4eoO/ljb3vllpDY1ctXGm5iGCW+2UlEPUYJnkVka2CX\nQrYrlkHAs7ZwKYPurZIyLzXqZl59TD5HoBMGuDvo/lsus59/BUdfuRZP5inasDksvjNdjg\nnSFtOqTymLU4u0N5w