:false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/a01d707c35c7d2c5b173717ee924cda38b7fa833","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKGEwMWQ3MDdjMzVjN2QyYzViMTczNzE3ZWU5MjRjZGEzOGI3ZmE4MzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385","sha":"b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385"}],"sha":"a01d707c35c7d2c5b173717ee924cda38b7fa833","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/a01d707c35c7d2c5b173717ee924cda38b7fa833"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:24:48Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T18:24:48Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"fix(preset): ES-DE output is now a complete ES-DE home tree (verified against real ES-DE 3.4.1)\n\nInstalled real ES-DE 3.4.1 (portable) and loaded a library generated by\nour engine. Empirical findings:\n\n- ROM folder layout roms/<system> is CORRECT: ES-DE discovered all\n  systems and all 4 test games (psx + dreamcast CHDs).\n- gamelist.xml in ROM folders is IGNORED by ES-DE 3.x (log: ''will not\n  get loaded''; user guide confirms ''ignored by default''). ES-DE\n  requires the centralized home tree: <home>/ES-DE/gamelists/<system>/\n  gamelist.xml. Verified both directions live (refusal + acceptance).\n- Our XML dialect (leading ./ paths, name/image tags) parses cleanly.\n\nPreset changes:\n- EsDe platform folders: roms/ -> ROMs/ (ES-DE home-tree casing).\n- EsDe gamelists now written to <out>/ES-DE/gamelists/<system>/\n  gamelist.xml, making the output a complete self-contained ES-DE home:\n  ''ES-DE.exe --home <output>'' just works (verified live: gamelists\n  parsed, 4 games, zero warnings).\n- Batocera unchanged: firmware reads gamelists from system folders.\n- Migrator: stale per-folder gamelists removed on EsDe targets (no\n  per-folder destination anymore); fresh centralized gamelists written;\n  Batocera keeps folder gamelists.\n\nKnown gap discovered: scanner does not ingest .chd inputs (already-\nconverted libraries), so preset-migration of an existing CHD library\ncurrently bypasses scan_and_plan — tracked for a follow-up.\n\nTests: 113 Rust + 29 Vitest green; real_world_test gains the ES-DE\nlibrary builder producing the verified layout.","tree":{"sha":"6e229a7c77c2c6f5b66e21e8edf692cf549d8e3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/6e229a7c77c2c6f5b66e21e8edf692cf549d8e3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKGIyNWMyOGVjNTk0ZDI5YmI5MTI0Y2E1Y2NiMmQzMzNjM2QyODAzODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6","sha":"52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6"}],"sha":"b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/b25c28ec594d29bb9124ca5ccb2d333c3d280385"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:55:14Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:55:14Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"fix(sd-card safety): trash refuses permanent deletion on volumes without a Recycle Bin\n\nReal-hardware finding (live-tested on a FAT32 SD card): trash::delete on\nremovable drives with recycling disabled PERMANENTLY deletes files, so\nthe UI''s ''restore from Recycle Bin'' promise was false in the app''s\nprimary use case — verified live: a probe file trashed from the card was\ngone with no bin anywhere.\n\n- trash_source_files now checks each target volume for $RECYCLE.BIN;\n  volumes without one (SD cards) refuse with a clear error unless the\n  caller passes allow_permanent=true. Nothing is deleted on refusal.\n- Step 4 modal gains a danger-mode second confirmation (red ''Yes, Delete\n  Permanently'') when the backend reports NO RECYCLE BIN.\n- Live regression tests on the real card: refusal leaves files\n  untouched; explicit confirmation proceeds. The .chd extension\nallow-list refusing outputs is asserted as a safety property (corrupt\noutput removal is a maintenance op, not the trash flow).\n\nReal-card session results captured in tests/real_world_test.rs:\n- Library health sweep: 70/72 CHDs verify clean; 2 corrupt identified.\n- Full repair pipeline staged: 8 verified CHDs (2.9GB) from the user''s\n  Vimm''s Lair archives; two dead playlists repaired on-card with\n  post-copy verification.","tree":{"sha":"2c598b9b3fc145357b45002fe6f511e21778c27a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/2c598b9b3fc145357b45002fe6f511e21778c27a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKDUyY2U0OWY4ZTFhYWUxMGY1MTExNDI1MGRjYTJkNDkxYzA4MTExZDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75","sha":"ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75"}],"sha":"52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/52ce49f8e1aae10f51114250dca2d491c08111d6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:14:11Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T13:14:11Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"fix: real-world validation round — 6 bugs found and fixed against actual data\n\nValidated the full pipeline against real hardware and real dumps\n(Vimm''s Lair extractions, real Redump DATs, real chdman 0.289, real SD\ncard structure) via a headless real-world harness plus GUI automation.\n\nBugs found by real data, all fixed and regression-tested:\n- Scanner duplicated Dreamcast games shipped as cue+gdi pairs\n  (Soulcalibur): overlapping track sets now deduplicate to the gdi.\n- Migrator mishandled root-relative playlist entries\n  (/_hidden/multi-disc/...): entries now resolve playlist-relative then\n  root-relative, like real frontends.\n- Migration dry-run silently ignored dead playlists: broken playlists\n  (referenced discs missing on disk) are now reported in the plan and\n  surfaced in the UI. Found 10 dead playlists on the real card.\n- Watch folder crashed the app: spawn_blocking from a sync command\n  panicked off-runtime (STATUS_STACK_BUFFER_OVERRUN). The watcher now\n  captures the runtime handle in async context and runs on a plain\n  thread; verified live (drop dump -> auto convert+verify -> ''Watch\n  pass complete'').\n- Plan mutation race: executing while a platform override was in\n  flight converted to stale paths (CHD in ROMS/UNKNOWN, art in ROMS/PS).\n  Plan mutations are now serialized and startExecution awaits them.\n- Rename button was display-only: renames now re-resolve output file\n  names via set_game_title (sanitized).\n\nNew capabilities validated against real data:\n- Per-game platform override (dry-run UI dropdown) for dumps in\n  per-game folders where folder-hint detection cannot infer platform.\n- One-click DAT download verified in-app (5 systems fetched live).\n- Real conversions: 73.2% compression on a 550MB PSX image, chdman\n  verify gate green, Finish Line artwork 3/3 via libretro thumbnails.\n\nTests: 113 Rust + 29 Vitest passing; new real-world harness\n(tests/real_world_test.rs, env-driven, ignored by default) covering\nscan/classify, conversion, finish line, migration, and watch passes\nagainst the staged real collection.","tree":{"sha":"e9fa6b6ecdb73d8ea68b9158efe62b7b421c69fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/e9fa6b6ecdb73d8ea68b9158efe62b7b421c69fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKGJhNjhjZGUxYzhkODJiN2IyOWU5ZDZhZmVjMzNkYmQ3ZDM0ZDNmNzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330","sha":"aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330"}],"sha":"ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/ba68cde1c8d82b7b29e9d6afec33dbd7d34d3f75"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:56:30Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:56:30Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"feat: preset migration, watch-folder auto-ingest, one-click Redump DATs, artwork grid\n\nRemaining roadmap features from the review brainstorm:\n\nPreset migration (device-switching without re-conversion):\n- New migrator module: plan_migration scans an organized library\n  (playlists + referenced CHDs + standalone CHDs), reverse-maps the\n  source preset''s folder layout to platforms, and computes target\n  paths for the destination preset. execute_migration moves files\n  (rename with cross-device copy fallback), rewrites playlist\n  entries, relocates artwork per the target preset''s conventions,\n  removes stale gamelist.xml, and regenerates fresh gamelists for\n  ES-DE/Batocera. Existing targets are never overwritten; reruns are\n  no-ops. Step 1 gains a collapsible MigrationPanel with dry-run\n  preview, live progress, and a summary.\n\nOne-click Redump DATs (verified live):\n- download_redump_dats fetches redump.org/datfile/{psx,ss,dc,mcd,pce}\n  ZIPs (slugs validated against an allow-list), extracts the .dat\n  into the app''s managed dats/ folder, and returns the paths. Step\n  1''s verification card offers per-system chips and merges results\n  into the DAT path list. A live ignored test downloads the real\n  PSX datfile (10,914 games) and parses it through load_dat_xml:\n  >9,000 entries indexed with correct platform classification.\n\nWatch folder (hands-free ingest):\n- New watch module (notify crate): recursive watcher with a 5s\n  debounce over disc-image activity; each quiet pass scans, classifies\n  (builtin Redump + filename fallback), converts and verifies via the\n  existing pipeline — sources untouched, trash decisions stay manual.\n  watch-status events drive a live status line; Step 1 gains a\n  Start/Stop Watching toggle bound to the current folders and preset.\n\nFinish Line polish:\n- FinishLibrarySummary carries artwork_paths; read_image_file serves\n  small PNG/JPG previews as data URLs (extension + 5MB validated),\n  and Step 4 renders a cover-art grid of downloaded box art.\n- gamelist.xml entries support <desc> (XML-escaped) for future\n  metadata enrichment.\n\nTests: 113 Rust + 29 Vitest passing, live DAT test verified; new\nsuites for migration (5), watch ingestion (3), and updated gamelist\ncoverage.","tree":{"sha":"abe8d6960af16d327b031f9b2d0a2b599df25e4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/abe8d6960af16d327b031f9b2d0a2b599df25e4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKGFhMGVjZGY5ODI3M2IyNzMxYmVmMzY5ZGVhOTlmZTA5Y2VkNmYzMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5","sha":"0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5"}],"sha":"aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/aa0ecdf98273b2731bef369dea99fe09ced6f330"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:30:32Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T06:30:32Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"feat: verification gate + Finish Line (box art & playlist metadata)\n\nVerification gate (trust):\n- Redump XML DAT support: load_dat_xml() parses Redump *.dat files\n  (quick-xml), infers the system from the DAT header, and indexes each\n  game''s first-track SHA-1 — matching the scanner''s full-file track-1\n  hash, so hash hits now mean byte-identical-to-Redump. Invalid hashes\n  are rejected.\n- scan_and_plan accepts redump_dat_paths; bogus paths fail loudly.\n  Step 1 gains an optional ''Redump DAT files'' field; RedumpCache\n  classifications with a DAT loaded are true verifications.\n- chdman verify gate: every converted disc now runs chdman verify\n  after the magic-byte check. A failed verification marks the game\n  failed, deletes the suspect CHD, and keeps its sources off the\n  trash list. Mock chdman implements a verify subcommand.\n\nFinish Line (new feature):\n- New metadata module: gamelist.xml writer (ES-DE / Batocera, with\n  XML escaping) and libretro thumbnail artwork resolution. Candidate\n  URLs try region-qualified names first (Final Fantasy VII (USA)),\n  matching the service''s real naming (verified live), then bare\n  titles across box art / title screens / snapshots.\n- finish_library command: downloads box art (keyless, skip-if-exists,\n  30s timeout) into media/images for gamelist presets or adjacent to\n  playlists for auto-load frontends, writes per-system gamelist.xml,\n  and emits artwork-progress events.\n- Step 4 gains a Finish Line card with per-game progress and results;\n  store gains redumpDats + finishLibrary with a reentrancy guard.\n\nTests: 102 Rust + 29 Vitest passing; new coverage for the DAT parser,\nloose platform inference, DAT-driven scan verification, the verify\ngate (blocks success + deletes bad CHD), gamelist generation/escape,\nURL candidates, and the finish_library flow against a local HTTP\nstand-in for the thumbnail service.","tree":{"sha":"b6febefc8dbe75dda20af772f5ed745c74ae0ddf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/b6febefc8dbe75dda20af772f5ed745c74ae0ddf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5","node_id":"C_kwDOUjGylNoAKDBmZjIxZmFhMTdmMmE4MmY1ZGM5M2YzZGU1OWY3MjRjZDQ3YTk4YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commit/43ad3da1160c3394384555c6d6cfbb2dc041f2a6","sha":"43ad3da1160c3394384555c6d6cfbb2dc041f2a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/43ad3da1160c3394384555c6d6cfbb2dc041f2a6"}],"sha":"0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/0ff21faa17f2a82f5dc93f3de59f724cd47a98a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/commits/43ad3da1160c3394384555c6d6cfbb2dc041f2a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:48:04Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:48:04Z","email":"aaronkmorrison@gmail.com","name":"myktytan"},"message":"fix: address PR review — real chdman source, capabilities, containment, failure UX\n\nP0 fixes:\n- chdman downloader: replace dead a37103/chdman-binaries URLs and\n  fabricated checksums with pinned @emmercm/chdman-* npm tarballs\n  (v0.289), hashes computed from the actual artifacts and verified by\n  a live download test (cargo test -- --ignored). Adds windows/linux\n  arm64 manifests and macOS dylib bundling on extract.\n- add src-tauri/capabilities/default.json (core:default) so frontend\n  listen() calls are granted; set a real CSP instead of null.\n- Redump tier: hash the full track-1 file (Redump semantics, no 16MB\n  prefix), reject non-hex keys in insert(), strip UTF-8 BOM in the CSV\n  loader. Builtin data remains a fixture; production DB still needs a\n  real dataset (tracked in review).\n\nP1 fixes:\n- containment: cue/gdi track references resolving outside the scan\n  root are skipped at scan time and excluded from the trash list;\n  trash_source_files validates extensions up front (atomic) and\n  enforces an optional base-dir containment check.\n- sanitization: titles/regions from Jev/filenames are sanitized into\n  path components; Jev regions normalized to the Redump vocabulary;\n  out-of-vocabulary platform answers no longer keep full confidence.\n- scan no longer aborts on one broken sheet: discs are skipped and\n  reported via IngestionPlan.skipped_sources, surfaced in Step 2.\n- multi-disc grouping now includes region (no more merging USA+Europe\n  dumps of the same title).\n- Custom preset is real: CustomPresetConfig threads through\n  scan_and_plan -> plan_builder -> resolve_target_paths, with folder\n  inputs in Step 1.\n- frontend: Step 4 hero reflects failed_games (partial/total failure),\n  Step 3 renders a failure state with Back-to-Plan and hides View\n  Summary without a summary, per-disc progress keying with per-game\n  averaging and disc-weighted overall progress, reentrancy guard on\n  startExecution, trash errors render inside the modal, fake Pause\n  button removed.\n\nP2 fixes: Jev client timeouts (10s connect / 45s total), output_dir\nvalidation (not a file, != input dir, created if missing), TAG_RE no\nlonger strips (Enhanced)/(Deluxe)-style tags, expanded region\nvocabulary, per-call regex compilation removed in cue parser.\n\nTests: 88 Rust + 28 Vitest passing; new coverage for trash validation,\nscan skip/containment, failure rendering, and progress accounting.","tree":{"sha":"562bb04d5dd111179ed288885da6de0f6975d251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/trees/562bb04d5dd111179ed288885da6de0f6975d251"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/toilmonkey0-cyber/rom-ingestion-engine/git/commits/43ad3da1160c3394384555c6d6cfbb2dc041f2a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204518673?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/myktytan","id":204518673,"login":"myktytan","node_id":"U_kgDODDC1EQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/myktytan","user_view_typ