eordered per\nslot) so pickMoodTags still has enough distinct options for 3 cards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9","tree":{"sha":"9fb8dd8dfb6d2e879acb62d3147942002850e238","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/trees/9fb8dd8dfb6d2e879acb62d3147942002850e238"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/commits/56ff6e176572947e91d7881287e15b76beed3a58","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fb8dd8dfb6d2e879acb62d3147942002850e238\nparent 91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597644 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597644 +0000\n\nExpand genre and mood options from 6/5 to 8 each\n\nAdded 힙합/클래식 genres and 로맨틱한/웅장한/편안한 moods to\nsrc/constants/music-taste.ts, with matching English search-term entries\nin mood-track''s GENRE_SEARCH_TERMS/MOOD_SEARCH_TERMS, and expanded every\ntime-of-day pool in src/lib/mood.ts to include all 8 moods (reordered per\nslot) so pickMoodTags still has enough distinct options for 3 cards.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKe1Sjss\nGJPVMuGcpcG81sKj4ZAOibVxRyJXuxcglRG6pzeVctvEeGqQhkFwGDOqELxqTsCIfKYn5fasZLXi\nvA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T12:14:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/56ff6e176572947e91d7881287e15b76beed3a58","node_id":"C_kwDOUjXMQNoAKDU2ZmY2ZTE3NjU3Mjk0N2U5MWQ3ODgxMjg3ZTE1Yjc2YmVlZDNhNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8","sha":"91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8"}],"sha":"56ff6e176572947e91d7881287e15b76beed3a58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/56ff6e176572947e91d7881287e15b76beed3a58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:10:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:10:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add a settings screen to edit music genre/mood preferences after onboarding\n\ntrip-setup.tsx (F1) only ever set music_genres/mood_preferences once\nduring onboarding, with no way to change them afterward. Adds\nsrc/app/music-preferences.tsx (outside the (tabs) group so it doesn''t\nbecome an extra tab button) reusing the same ChipSelect UI, backed by a\nnew updateTrip() helper in src/lib/profile.ts. Wired a \"음악 취향 수정\"\nbutton into the settings screen.\n\nExtracted GENRE_OPTIONS/MOOD_OPTIONS/MAX_SELECTION into\nsrc/constants/music-taste.ts so trip-setup and this new screen share one\nsource of truth instead of duplicating the chip lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9","tree":{"sha":"3fc9bd7adcea568dd1af08236eb134274cfbfa8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/trees/3fc9bd7adcea568dd1af08236eb134274cfbfa8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/commits/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fc9bd7adcea568dd1af08236eb134274cfbfa8b\nparent 2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597443 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597443 +0000\n\nAdd a settings screen to edit music genre/mood preferences after onboarding\n\ntrip-setup.tsx (F1) only ever set music_genres/mood_preferences once\nduring onboarding, with no way to change them afterward. Adds\nsrc/app/music-preferences.tsx (outside the (tabs) group so it doesn''t\nbecome an extra tab button) reusing the same ChipSelect UI, backed by a\nnew updateTrip() helper in src/lib/profile.ts. Wired a \"음악 취향 수정\"\nbutton into the settings screen.\n\nExtracted GENRE_OPTIONS/MOOD_OPTIONS/MAX_SELECTION into\nsrc/constants/music-taste.ts so trip-setup and this new screen share one\nsource of truth instead of duplicating the chip lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFPaIN+t\nHzbB/1W5/RvKmNP1y9boYJHqxSREF56DVE7JGDW9CxWNaW4/S7UThHGsr7gZGz896NnOPxywpawx\n5ws=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T12:10:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8","node_id":"C_kwDOUjXMQNoAKDkxNDUzYjFhMDFiYTY4NGE4OWY4ZWE5MzYyZDY4MzA2Mzk1NmZhZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8","sha":"2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8"}],"sha":"91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/91453b1a01ba684a89f8ea9362d683063956fae8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:05:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:05:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Wire trip music_genres into mood-track search (was collected, never used)\n\ntrip-setup.tsx has always saved genre chips (인디/팝/재즈/로파이/K-POP/어쿠스틱)\ninto trips.music_genres, but nothing ever read that column back — the\nDeezer search only ever used the mood tag, so genre selection had zero\neffect on recommendations, which is the bug reported.\n\nmood-track now accepts an optional `genre`, translated via\nGENRE_SEARCH_TERMS the same way mood tags are, and appended to the search\nquery. The home screen cycles through the trip''s selected genres across\nthe 3 cards so each one reflects a genre the traveler actually picked.\n\nDeezer''s public search has no real genre filter (only a Genre/Chart\nendpoint keyed by numeric genre id), so this is a free-text keyword boost,\nnot a guaranteed filter — noted in the function''s comments. Better than\nbefore (0% influence), not a hard guarantee every result matches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9","tree":{"sha":"8bac356c641d6b802ba9b5e65f4e5fee777b83c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/trees/8bac356c641d6b802ba9b5e65f4e5fee777b83c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/commits/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8bac356c641d6b802ba9b5e65f4e5fee777b83c8\nparent 84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597136 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790597136 +0000\n\nWire trip music_genres into mood-track search (was collected, never used)\n\ntrip-setup.tsx has always saved genre chips (인디/팝/재즈/로파이/K-POP/어쿠스틱)\ninto trips.music_genres, but nothing ever read that column back — the\nDeezer search only ever used the mood tag, so genre selection had zero\neffect on recommendations, which is the bug reported.\n\nmood-track now accepts an optional `genre`, translated via\nGENRE_SEARCH_TERMS the same way mood tags are, and appended to the search\nquery. The home screen cycles through the trip''s selected genres across\nthe 3 cards so each one reflects a genre the traveler actually picked.\n\nDeezer''s public search has no real genre filter (only a Genre/Chart\nendpoint keyed by numeric genre id), so this is a free-text keyword boost,\nnot a guaranteed filter — noted in the function''s comments. Better than\nbefore (0% influence), not a hard guarantee every result matches.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIsWFANU\nj9PopXuQjVKmmidCtBFJDoVs3hdEMd09IJElylPIWwDZ2lTOlrV/SFXUulEtQvPMU47IgC4V4qxs\negE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T12:05:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8","node_id":"C_kwDOUjXMQNoAKDJkOGIzMjBlMDRiZjY3ZTI2NmQ0MTk2MjRlMGNhNjkyMWM1MjFmYjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/yerinni/ai_practice/commit/84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea","sha":"84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea"}],"sha":"2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/2d8b320e04bf67e266d419624e0ca6921c521fb8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/commits/84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:02:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T12:02:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Show 3 mood recommendation cards on the home screen instead of 1\n\nAdds pickMoodTags() to src/lib/mood.ts, which repeatedly calls\npickMoodTag() with an accumulating exclude list to get distinct mood\ntags (expanded each time-of-day pool to all 5 moods, ordered by fit, so\n3 distinct picks don''t run out of options). The home screen now fetches\n3 tracks in parallel, logs a mood_recommendations row per card, and lets\neach card be played/saved independently. \"다른 느낌으로\" marks all 3\ncurrent rows as changed and reloads a fresh set of 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9","tree":{"sha":"ec3b46d7c36511471275ee43b6ba4d393093da8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/trees/ec3b46d7c36511471275ee43b6ba4d393093da8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yerinni/ai_practice/git/commits/84df94f094de7de666994ae1c9273938dd91ceea","verification":{"payload":"tree ec3b46d7c36511471275ee43b6ba4d393093da8d\nparent aae5a7a363cf1cdbecb39fc5de4130ef700968c9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790596963 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790596963 +0000\n\nShow 3 mood recommendation cards on the home screen instead of 1\n\nAdds pickMoodTags() to src/lib/mood.ts, which repeatedly calls\npickMoodTag() with an accumulating exclude list to get distinct mood\ntags (expanded each time-of-day pool to all 5 moods, ordered by fit, so\n3 distinct picks don''t run out of options). The home screen now fetches\n3 tracks in parallel, logs a mood_recommendations row per card, and lets\neach card be played/saved independently. \"다른 느낌으로\" marks all 3\ncurrent rows as changed and reloads a fresh set of 3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HC1smVb7bxSwWomzaeSXo9\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLkK1Yfu\nFRwRV2qsb08pDpEXKJKGMy1FZYUttmMwBEde3jWVFk0N8XugMjZMpTc6mAcaP7pckCY4rIcP3x7L\nvAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T12:02:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.githu