ekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/fe8f52eaa0aa0c20c53a204bec54e8020e8d0928","node_id":"C_kwDOUjdTeNoAKGZlOGY1MmVhYTBhYTBjMjBjNTNhMjA0YmVjNTRlODAyMGU4ZDA5Mjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a","sha":"0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a"}],"sha":"fe8f52eaa0aa0c20c53a204bec54e8020e8d0928","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/fe8f52eaa0aa0c20c53a204bec54e8020e8d0928"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:31:14Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T05:31:14Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"message":"feat: add per-route error boundaries with sticky-until-retry crashes\n\nAdds a crash demo (Dining tab, plus a child-route Menu screen) and a\nshared RouteErrorBoundary (@mfe/design-system) that every MFE now wraps\naround each of its own <Route> elements, including nested/child routes -\nnot just one boundary around the whole remote. A crash in one screen\n(e.g. Menu) shows an error only in that screen''s own slot; the parent\nlayout''s header/tabs and sibling routes (e.g. Reviews) keep working.\n\nAlso fixes a real bug this surfaced: RemoteLoader (and RemoteErrorBoundary\ninside it) was being reused across Bookings/Dining/Payments tab switches\ninstead of remounting, since React saw the same component type at the\nsame tree position - a crash on one tab could then show on whichever tab\nwas visited next. Fixed with a per-tab `key` on RemoteLoader, and the same\n`key`-per-slot pattern is used for every per-route boundary too.\n\nPer client feedback, a crash is meant to stay visibly broken across\nnavigation until \"Retry\" is explicitly pressed, not silently heal itself\njust from being unmounted and remounted. Since React component state\ncan''t survive an actual unmount, both RouteErrorBoundary and the Shell''s\nown RemoteErrorBoundary now track \"still broken\" in an external,\npage-load-scoped store keyed by route identity, checked on every\n(re)mount - remounting still prevents cross-route bleed, it just no\nlonger implies \"fixed.\"\n\nFallback UI now shows both where (which screen) and why (the actual\ncaught error''s message) something broke, instead of a generic\n\"unavailable\" string.","tree":{"sha":"6812a3a8f8a285d95a6131c75d92f3bfbd396bc9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/trees/6812a3a8f8a285d95a6131c75d92f3bfbd396bc9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/commits/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a","node_id":"C_kwDOUjdTeNoAKDAzODkwMjRlZDVjMWNkZTY3YzU4ZjVlMDgxM2I3YWZlYzhiZjllM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9","sha":"d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9"}],"sha":"0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/0389024ed5c1cde67c58f5e0813b7afec8bf9e3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:00:35Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T13:00:35Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"message":"feat: deploy the real Ship Server backend to Render\n\nAdds render.yaml (Render Blueprint) + scripts/deploy-render.mjs so\napps/ship-server can run as a real, persistent Node process on Render,\nalongside the existing static Vercel demo target. render:build wraps the\nsame build -> deploy -> activate release pipeline the manual ship:build /\nship:deploy / ship:activate commands run, with a unique release id\nderived from the commit Render is building.\n\nUnlike the static Vercel build, login/session/logout/crew-log all\ngenuinely work on Render since it''s the real Express backend - the\nVercel target has no server at all (see the new README section\nexplaining why only one of the two can run the auth flow).\n\nTwo server.mjs changes needed to run correctly behind Render''s proxy\nrather than ship-local: trust proxy (so Express can see the original\nrequest was HTTPS, since Render terminates TLS at its own edge) and the\nsession cookie''s Secure flag now comes from req.secure instead of being\nhardcoded off, so the same code is correct in both environments.","tree":{"sha":"aefbecd34b21a87ed82642abdd97562d260bba33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/trees/aefbecd34b21a87ed82642abdd97562d260bba33"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/commits/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9","node_id":"C_kwDOUjdTeNoAKGQwMTJlNDAwZWNkYmJlM2I4Y2ZiYWFkOTExNTAzOTJlMzU2NTM2Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0","sha":"3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0"}],"sha":"d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/d012e400ecdbbe3b8cfbaad91150392e356536b9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:49:11Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:49:11Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"message":"fix: build signin-mfe into the static Vercel demo bundle\n\nisMfeManifest() validates any manifest against the full MFE_NAMES list\nregardless of which target produced it, so leaving signin-mfe out of\nbuild-static-demo.mjs meant the static build''s 3-entry manifest failed\nschema validation on load, breaking every route on Vercel (not just\nsign-in) - \"Unable to reach the Ship Server. Manifest failed schema\nvalidation.\"\n\nThe sign-in flow itself is still unreachable in practice on this static\ntarget (api/session.json is a fixed always-200 stub, so AuthGate never\nroutes to /signin there), but the manifest now has to be schema-complete\nregardless.","tree":{"sha":"482ab6b3d5b32c446d6e4734a1390bca2a9be6ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/trees/482ab6b3d5b32c446d6e4734a1390bca2a9be6ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/commits/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0","node_id":"C_kwDOUjdTeNoAKDNlNzE5MzE2MGU3ZWUxMmZlMDY1ZjcyM2VlNDU1ZDU0NGI5M2MyZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commit/945e8987c05b11d80ebe52db0438cdf082de520c","sha":"945e8987c05b11d80ebe52db0438cdf082de520c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/945e8987c05b11d80ebe52db0438cdf082de520c"}],"sha":"3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/3e7193160e7ee12fe065f723ee455d544b93c2d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commits/945e8987c05b11d80ebe52db0438cdf082de520c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:43:47Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T12:43:47Z","email":"vivekrekhadia007@gmail.com","name":"vivekrekhadia"},"message":"feat: add sign-in MFE with real ship-local session auth\n\nAdds apps/signin-mfe as a fourth Module Federation remote (full release\nparity with bookings/dining/payment) that owns the sign-in form and\nsession creation, while the Shell only checks token validity on load and\nredirects (AuthGate in apps/shell/src/App.tsx).\n\nShip Server (apps/ship-server) issues real opaque session tokens as\nhttpOnly cookies via POST /api/auth/login, enforced on GET /api/session\nand the new GET /api/crew-log demo endpoint. For this demo, any\nnon-empty username/password is accepted (no fixed credential store) so\nthe flow is easy to try, but the token itself is real and genuinely\nrequired - CrewLogDemo.tsx proves this by calling the same protected\nendpoint with and without the session cookie.\n\nAlso includes: release-pipeline updates so signin-mfe builds/deploys/\nactivates like the other MFEs, a shared loading-skeleton moved into\n@mfe/design-system so any MFE can use it, and several sign-in UI/layout\nfixes (two-panel layout, card width, helper-note trims).","tree":{"sha":"671c1ab3c380ede24f067da39c0817b6155eb30e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/trees/671c1ab3c380ede24f067da39c0817b6155eb30e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/git/commits/945e8987c05b11d80ebe52db0438cdf082de520c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69665722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia","id":69665722,"login":"vivekrekhadia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjY1NzIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vivekrekhadia","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vivekrekhadia/mfe-demo/commi