:{"date":"2026-09-21T08:43:44Z","email":"adenugbafavour@gmail.com","name":"thebigbillz"},"message":"Delivery: hand-built staffing grid\n\nWork breakdown and staffing as one surface of flex rows: no table, grid or tree package. Derived rows are read-only; person cells under a leaf take arrows, Enter, F2, Tab, Esc and Delete. Committing unchanged text writes nothing, so reading a value in another unit can never alter it. Over-capacity, split-rate, no-rate and outside-project states each have their own mark.","tree":{"sha":"05c082c62c9c4eb33348dbd505884695c03c46f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thebigbillz/baseline-planning-suite/git/trees/05c082c62c9c4eb33348dbd505884695c03c46f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thebigbillz/baseline-planning-suite/git/commits/ff5b64eb61302cafde189744be611484ad084961","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/37770060?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/thebigbillz","id":37770060,"login":"thebigbillz","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzcwMDYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thebigbillz","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/thebigbillz/baseline-planning-suite/commit/ff5b64eb61302cafde