tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crufter/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crufter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljzljz520-eng/1backend_fork2/commits/b10ea0c4791b053528b8541b4cc447f07175b738/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:11:24Z","email":"dobronszki@gmail.com","name":"Janos Dobronszki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-22T16:11:24Z","email":"dobronszki@gmail.com","name":"Janos Dobronszki"},"message":"refactor(user): centralize organization token issuance and fix stale permission bug\n\nRefactors organization activation and creation logic to use a unified, concurrency-safe token issuance method. This fixes a security/functional bug where newly created organization roles were not immediately encoded into the user''s JWT upon organization creation, causing permission sync issues.\n\nChanges include:\n- Extracted token generation into `issueTokenForActiveOrganization` to eliminate code duplication between activation and creation handlers.\n- Introduced `s.acquireRefreshTokenLock` during issuance to prevent race conditions during concurrent authentication cycles.\n- Added role merging via `appendUniqueRoles` to ensure the creator''s new organization permissions are instantly applied.\n- Fixed a silent error suppression bug in `createUserWithoutVerification`.","tree":{"sha":"c95acc1ff67c725b96cbbedc59fe8b9ad8103c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljzljz520-eng/1backend_fork2/git/trees/c95acc1ff67c725b96cbbedc59fe8b9ad8103c73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ljzljz520-eng/1backend_fork2/git/commits/b10ea0c4791b053528b8541b4cc447f07175b738","verification":{"payload":"tree c95acc1ff67c725b96cbbedc59fe8b9ad8103c73\nparent 623a718170f6ffe2d6866c2f14ea8aefcb80c8fb\nauthor Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1779466284 +0200\ncommitter Janos Dobronszki <dobronszki@gmail.com> 1779466284 +0200\n\nrefactor(user): centralize organization token issuance and fix stale permission bug\n\nRefactors organization activation and creation logic to use a unified, concurrency-safe token issuance method. This fixes a security/functional bug where newly created organization roles were not immediately encoded into the user''s JWT upon organization creation, causing permission sync issues.\n\nChanges include:\n- Extracted token generation into `issueTokenForActiveOrganization` to eliminate code duplication between activation and creation handlers.\n- Introduced `s.acquireRefreshTokenLock` during issuance to prevent race conditions during concurrent authentication cycles.\n- Added role merging via `appendUniqueRoles` to ensure the creator''s new organization permissions are instantly applied.\n- Fixed a silent error suppression bug in `createUserWithoutVerification`.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEWfq+Xgbpfqd6MzfQvDpRVu99XisFAmoQgCwACgkQvDpRVu99\nXitXcBAArlrbVCjonoNVMWY6kOvLc73J3VSbaO0XIyoBrGD8sHL10/EZODTfTXMD\nNuF6+1jD6tyoC4egEgEsdJFtgaFZjsKaFi/caXVE3NbGZxNnXr/hxJzb5RhwOWmj\nQt0OD0JmtQ9hx9RzmWPeWxrO2jhwhfG7aAtzRM3veb3Hqkc0WLPMJ6KJ1zLMLIJZ\nrMBF5uvn1ZIQ3JFKz9F5+oyBwOVLg4W1cjbLkt2NgkuLM54ze29jloK8MifgYN/O\nzxDuB8zZpY/QzJD5iEVh+B1ZkGOAFAGWIn9I/ZBiqprw/7Ewj5a1JSEjjyf2KBOB\nx5ANQReqFsaXg4PRc5SHPfDRJWvLE14QZ3mKlZejLcCiQf1lyq1jkyfREPE5+noB\nS/AbanwrjzC67wPdtTkUoOsq/V57m2Zs+RHqsWU4Wz5o4nQ5iA9jmPpnUlZsgeH3\nwDvLgr/bDOSLkMz34+z/O8GuvD/Mo3BYkCXWgI65Q6bPimx0SNWnrawDXRZs18Ui\nQDo7p4FFs0XcGOmlPFC+Rv8zSV3ljuengVRj/cMaSnL3SqoPfdDDdyRlmKsd8Y4r\nRASHfX95+4nGrDJYq/GuAPP8V0C+z3CFdxgZHC25vMWoYVyQpq3UnT5RTU5aEi24\nmBa0dtLBa1//YHoLuC0rmCfETvpCHWiLN+e+n0IWVmQZpPmtm4k=\n=hmnH\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T09:29:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1193872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crufter/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crufter/followers","fo