f2bfecbbe439a81752feccf51dd3fca8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:56:27Z","email":"eddy.boutros.36@gmail.com","name":"AdibBoutros"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T17:56:27Z","email":"eddy.boutros.36@gmail.com","name":"AdibBoutros"},"message":"tests that would catch a regression, and the two bugs they found\n\nevery test now drives the running services and asserts exact values; waits are bounded\nconditions, not sleeps; each refusal has a sibling showing the allowed case; the fleet test\nno longer inherits flows from the tests before it; and each assertion was proven by breaking\nthe line it guards. the angular scaffold specs, which asserted a heading that no longer\nexists, are gone.\n\ntwo bugs came out of it. a filed or tagged document wrote its feed line once per workspace\ninstance: the line is now keyed on the moment the documents service made the change, which\nit stamps on the event, so replicas agree and a later move into the same folder is a line of\nits own. and asking a sign-off of someone who does not exist answered internal, because the\nschema did not declare the error it threw.","tree":{"sha":"35c3fbac934a8b1aee4252d626b7926d6fd24216","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eddyboutros/rayfold-apps/git/trees/35c3fbac934a8b1aee4252d626b7926d6fd24216"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eddyboutros/rayfold-apps/git/commits/e45e725f2bfecbbe439a81752feccf51dd3fca8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50780091?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddyboutros/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddyboutros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddyboutros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eddyboutros/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/eddyboutros","id":50780091,"login"