ations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/commits/43197010ba9f031ce5e7c39afa44a2fa50f60a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:50:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:50:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"test: align connection runners with editable per-Environment Connections\n\n- application-connection-kind-human: Save connection (no Set/Locked), editable Generation 0 control, refresh/restart persistence, stale-version and idempotent probes, empty-environment rebind (default -> own Connection), and a runtime-exists check that requires Review transition instead of a plain Save.\n- application-connection-kind-video.sh: final probe expects 409 RUNTIME_EXISTS (staging) and STALE_VERSION (production) and verifies the refused probes left bindings unchanged; header/notes updated.\n- application-connection-local.mjs / -playwright-local.sh: same editable semantics; also drop the stale ''default'' option label and exempt only the secretStoreKey field name from the credential-word redaction check (both runners).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Kj1dj9VTZgtjCZuuzuG2h","tree":{"sha":"de46498b3827b48e3e6da343af0ddade1cdb9a3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/git/trees/de46498b3827b48e3e6da343af0ddade1cdb9a3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/git/commits/43197010ba9f031ce5e7c39afa44a2fa50f60a43","verification":{"