/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/commits/3a8f77f87fb1d01aad666072021119fe972e76ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:32:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T04:32:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix: recorder secret scan distinguishes the active masked token field from real leaks\n\nReact mirrors a controlled password input''s value into its value attribute, so page.content().includes(token) always fails while a token is being filled in. Replace it with a structural scan (text, title, URL, cookies, storage, every attribute, every field value) exempting only the value of the active password input; after submission nothing is exempt. Unit-tested against the real Secret stores page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016Kj1dj9VTZgtjCZuuzuG2h","tree":{"sha":"d358b8c100daa90c46a038828a9a96d3dd575bb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/git/trees/d358b8c100daa90c46a038828a9a96d3dd575bb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pr3s3nt/poc/git/commits/3a8f77f87fb1d01aad666072021119fe972e76ac","verification":{"payload":"tree d358b8c100daa90c46a038828a9a96d3dd575bb9\nparent 68b167fb50cd934eed2fbc6a34191f77123510b9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791433957 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791433957 +0000\n\nfix: recorder secret scan distinguishes the active masked token field from real leaks\n\nReact mirrors a controlled password input''s value into its value attribute, so page.content().includes(token) always fails while a token is being filled in. Replace it with a structural scan (text, title, URL, cookies, storage, every attribute, every field value) exempting only the value of the active password input; after submission nothing is exempt. Unit-tested against the real Secret stores page.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: h