","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nivek9922","id":78772463,"login":"nivek9922","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NzcyNDYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nivek9922","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nivek9922/kevin-portafolio/commits/4055603e45164a5306717bf6013629a3a9231d74/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:15:54Z","email":"nivek9922@gmail.com","name":"nivek9922"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T02:15:54Z","email":"nivek9922@gmail.com","name":"nivek9922"},"message":"fix(layout): balance two-column sections to remove empty space\n\nAddresses design review feedback about visible gaps where one column ran\nmuch longer than the other.\n\n- Home: project shortcuts move to a full-width row below the portrait and\n  summary; the summary is centred against the portrait\n- Smart Financial: \"Decisions and responsibilities\" spans the full width\n  with its items in columns\n- KYZZ: the architecture group spans the full width below the columns\n- Citavek: \"What I built\" shows its notes by default (new `expanded` prop\n  on DiagramNode), so key content is visible without hovering\n- Project cases stack below ~700px instead of leaving a tall empty column","tree":{"sha":"e78f8a4fa6dc7e3fb93d853eb7e667530ffaad2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nivek9922/kevin-portafolio/git/trees/e78f8a4fa6dc7e3f