tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:41:29Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"Add GitHub Actions CI workflow\n\nBuild, vet and test through `make check`, and run golangci-lint, on every push\nand pull request targeting master. The Go version is read from go.mod so the\nworkflow cannot drift from the project toolchain, and golangci-lint is pinned\nto v2.13.2, which is built with Go 1.26 and can therefore lint a Go 1.26\ntarget. setup-go already caches modules and build output, so no separate cache\nstep is needed.","tree":{"sha":"fda6c3ee60ef6ec0ddcf48e1a5b4861144c880eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/fda6c3ee60ef6ec0ddcf48e1a5b4861144c880eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/d3256845ce4144e137addef298542167728f3396","verification":{"payload":"tree fda6c3ee60ef6ec0ddcf48e1a5b4861144c880eb\nparent 899915d5e3873063c6c270309059e6e413f66393\nauthor tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790021872 +0200\ncommitter tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790023289 +0200\n\nAdd GitHub Actions CI workflow\n\nBuild, vet and test through `make check`, and run golangci-lint, on every push\nand pull request targeting master. The Go version is read from go.mod so the\nworkflow cannot drift from the project toolchain, and golangci-lint is pinned\nto v2.13.2, which is built with Go 1.26 and can therefore lint a Go 1.26\ntarget. setup-go already caches modules and build output, so no separate cache\nstep is needed.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEqHC5qN+G7Eu3b6+UG1zZRWvZgtkFAmqxlnkACgkQG1zZRWvZ\ngtkZpQ//SIjOzFgaJZLBXETThxsoMwf8PV7NmhX4k6vXqQ+gvuBBVQxsdA06Gi7J\nh4z/RWV+EAq2lGlejqQd2NcOz12WFC5UDdlRQdVn9gSkEGCNASCdktBZS/yP3Udh\n7VT0VsVOo6Dn6Mtaa+GmJYtpfmq6RBNZHuT03+7RAmHzqdVvJWxqrPialueMFLAY\ngzvRFsVIZFVE/kzj3akZhdT0NVMFLOuZF3jvEPS41GyIqqRKUY5m11MoGuPlpIgX\npK5qPBYzpT4X8tgZROWahnxfRlCNJnKK84mW8QEp2U