ml_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/899915d5e3873063c6c270309059e6e413f66393","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDg5OTkxNWQ1ZTM4NzMwNjNjNmMyNzAzMDkwNTllNmU0MTNmNjYzOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/5a72ca25ca81e552e666518546e3ba9ec8ce4363","sha":"5a72ca25ca81e552e666518546e3ba9ec8ce4363","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/5a72ca25ca81e552e666518546e3ba9ec8ce4363"}],"sha":"899915d5e3873063c6c270309059e6e413f66393","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/899915d5e3873063c6c270309059e6e413f66393"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/5a72ca25ca81e552e666518546e3ba9ec8ce4363/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:00:33Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"Add --probabilities debug output and record the first real microphone test\n\nThe detector gains an OnProbability option and a LastProbability accessor so\nthe raw model output can be observed after each invocation. The CLI exposes it\nas --probabilities. The plan and README record the first smoke test on a real\nmicrophone and the capture gain pitfalls it revealed: a clipped input gives a\nflat zero probability, a too quiet one is never detected.","tree":{"sha":"544ba9b9fb864963b9e837eef972945ecb28278f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/544ba9b9fb864963b9e837eef972945ecb28278f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/5a72ca25ca81e552e666518546e3ba9ec8ce4363","verification":{"payload":"tree 544ba9b9fb864963b9e837eef972945ecb28278f\nparent 51efcf0d90f2e61991c6e0c1fb3c3659a1b06af6\nauthor tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790019363 +0000\ncommitter tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790020833 +0200\n\nAdd --probabilities debug output and record the first real microphone test\n\nThe detector gains an OnProbability option and a LastProbability accessor so\nthe raw model output can be observed after each invocation. The CLI exposes it\nas --probabilities. The plan and README record the first smoke test on a real\nmicrophone and the capture gain pitfalls it revealed: a clipped input gives a\nflat zero probability, a too quiet one is never detected.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEqHC5qN+G7Eu3b6+UG1zZRWvZgtkFAmqxjOEACgkQG1zZRWvZ\ngtnTYQ/9EYnULBoRHrG07f2ym/UHHigcYuc/NePCwCX8oer7zSTJumzstPvfmeUr\nZpGw+zJoJyM9DVOVg6hQgRcKGKdbKuM0JTkUVzO6xy11NCk3BLc2/aNvQUFVGX8Q\nRusThd4l5RDlHp72/m2MUB+MJGOQZvcti+Q+gGnoZQt85f7w/HkA2NRQwkPHlfFU\nNlfH7YlSsMParDP/DOxE5hKGdJU1yNpHSk/8UvDNpWg9JT3HsPz6WYHnLb9adYwA\nPkd0ZkonhKRsRnB8JhW7R8PnhmjchnNZ8yrlh+KFeFTVaWUiX2NI9w/04ZybA27a\njS7NoHBQlH8ZmBU31hjNcJElzpJG74QHySDmPSw1cCUu2R68Kmh7l4hVTNlPZR3c\nZvlLXz9FEjeW7SjM6urXSstotuF4ayOzLqWiYXNsTgGW0yrbqi8cPkz5+WheMx8+\n17w8nXtJgaq76Xx4zgaWFkVs4L7lhTH6wRHKbTPAdjEO+gJ3wz2w7Iobhoa5dNwk\nKMlI5jF8dkMKy5g569p0oq8d