:"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/9a487174d1a93f926f984f3a6980240dee5f5fac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T20:00:33Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"wake word detector and CLI\n\nPort the ESPHome streaming decision logic (stride buffer, probability\nring, ignore-windows warm-up and refractory period, VAD gate) into the\nwakeword package, behind a Scorer interface so the logic is tested with\nscripted probabilities. The manifest cutoff is truncated to uint8 as\nESPHome''s code generator does. The cmd/wakeword CLI detects on WAV files,\nraw PCM on stdin or replayed golden features, and dumps frontend features.\nTests that invoke a full model skip themselves until Phase 4 registers\nthe LOGISTIC and QUANTIZE kernels.","tree":{"sha":"95172a271f88fbe7839208ac2c44444369973b55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/95172a271f88fbe7839208ac2c44444369973b55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/9a487174d1a93f926f984f3a6980240dee5f5fac","verification":{"payload":"tree 95172a271f88fbe7839208ac2c44444369973b55\nparent 4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410\nauthor tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790019363 +0000\ncommitter tgallice <tmgallice@gmail.com> 1790020833 +0200\n\nwake word detector and CLI\n\nPort the ESPHome streaming decision logic (stride buffer, probability\nring, ignore-windows warm-up and refractory period, VAD gate) into the\nwakeword package, behind a Scorer interface so the logic is tested with\nscripted probabilities. The manifest cutoff is truncated to uint8 as\nESPHome''s code generator does. The cmd/wakeword CLI detects on WAV files,\nraw PCM on stdin or replayed golden features, and dumps frontend features.\nTests that invoke a full model skip themselves until Phase 4 registers\nthe LOGISTIC and QUANTIZE kernels.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEqHC5qN+G7Eu3b6+UG1zZRWvZgtkFAmqxjOEACgkQG1zZRWvZ\ngtmJEg//aWtwNFAHh7YQ0ELjcQJapOJDsm2iEKaaBrQBEkPHPOnNGXV7V4yKsT8+\nSVTtGwKqDdDq4NdSmQxiXFzNzYZ649PvFutGEaglWmAVhfnDBHvqhhACOvwT3h/c\nfKsXeg7CpTYjJO8MzE8jfs5GfhVcnZ2wFLFDYKVh+RQvrGk/XAW/iAOvR2pDccs/\nUIKmBbbjP0TS05DLwX9zhbdQff2LG8sXVu9EqQXrH80g9LEaeJXT+otvVsgMW9jI\nRdPzdTFlxDFywu6PMdV4fEvstw+G/y3/yQSwkBpFqLkBdA/LalSzBfkQomaIQ/oL\nU9gC/WFTzkyryq3gA3HJmmGtzLAQFd1aII8Qz9SXdnNTiK7nTJSvd8aeGPVffFhA\nIdfPq6GFQu9JRaYba8GEnhHOiDmaUdDOAUKmXnm5qo/mST20brfyAF5BEDf96axX\n/TLYtgCkXuLGUNGfERr4F6TzIMJjZRezWDF/QYcvQul0yy+gtr1HgAZDeZf6eFEw\nD1NiBD1HYXSlwh78wXrOzxjmIw2Jt6G0a59a/8WosQlLZGRLiuzSZ8y8eQbb1jCb\naUSrqfIqDs4DafIqGXpyMBzGTPtZ6zpIjzrldyAXU4ep9nlmObB89EkBACW7aCt0\nm0rMEwotOVtrCktDKOsti12osFCYn0jtwzRQc6NoK0q41ppF0cM=\n=LaL6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-21T20:01:40Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/9a487174d1a93f926f984f3a6980240dee5f5fac","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDlhNDg3MTc0ZDFhOTNmOTI2Zjk4NGYzYTY5ODAyNDBkZWU1ZjVmYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410","sha":"4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410"}],"sha":"9a487174d1a93f926f984f3a6980240dee5f5fac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/9a487174d1a93f926f984f3a6980240dee5f5fac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:28Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"int8 LOGISTIC, QUANTIZE and end-to-end model parity\n\nPort the gemmlowp fixed-point sigmoid (exp_on_negative_values,\none_over_one_plus_x_for_x_in_0_1, logistic) and the int8 LOGISTIC reference\nkernel with its prepare step from logistic_common.cc, plus the int8 to uint8\nRequantize of QUANTIZE. The loader now rejects any LOGISTIC output\nquantization other than zero point -128 and scale 1/256.\n\nInvoke runs the whole graph: every sequence of every parity file replays\nwith exact uint8 outputs on all 13,200 invocations, with fresh interpreters\nand with Reset between sequences, and every recorded trace matches tensor\nby tensor after Invoke. Both operators match all 280 trace instances each.\nInvoke and Reset allocate nothing; a full invocation takes 34 to 81 us\ndepending on the model.","tree":{"sha":"e315f7d7c92125a37ef89cc0d11b2ff089585bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/e315f7d7c92125a37ef89cc0d11b2ff089585bd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDRlMDRjZjAzZGUzZjVmNDIzNTJiMzkxNDk1ZWRlYmFjNWE5MDI0MTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b","sha":"932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b"}],"sha":"4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/4e04cf03de3f5f42352b391495edebac5a902410"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:27Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"pure Go port of the tflite-micro audio frontend\n\nAdd the frontend package: Hann window (Q12), kissfft real FFT in 16 bit\nfixed point, mel filterbank with 64 bit accumulation and integer square\nroot, noise reduction, PCAN gain control and fixed point log, plus the\nESPHome uint16 to int8 feature conversion. Every stage mirrors the C\ninteger widths and rounding; tables are built once at construction with\nthe same float32 math as the C code.\n\nTests replay the 8 oracle signals of testdata/frontend (1584 frames,\n63360 features) with exact equality on consumption, frame presence,\nuint16 values and int8 conversion, plus analytic checks of the window,\nFFT, filterbank layout, noise reduction, gain table and log. Process and\nReset do not allocate.","tree":{"sha":"ba0b4175faba62886b3bef86bae55e1c93757c0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/ba0b4175faba62886b3bef86bae55e1c93757c0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDkzMjE5OWFkM2I1OTViOTQ4NzJhYTA2NmRmY2Q3MDExMjU0NjE4NGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036","sha":"91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036"}],"sha":"932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/932199ad3b595b94872aa066dfcd70112546184b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:27Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"int8 requantization and convolution kernels with trace parity\n\nPort QuantizeMultiplier, SaturatingRoundingDoublingHighMul, RoundingDivideByPOT\nand the double-rounding MultiplyByQuantizedMultiplier from the TFLite reference.\nPer-channel output multipliers, shifts, offsets and activation ranges are\ncomputed once at interpreter creation. CONV_2D, DEPTHWISE_CONV_2D and\nFULLY_CONNECTED follow reference/integer_ops line by line and match every\ninstance in the parity traces of the five v2 models (1344, 1176 and 280\ninstances) with zero allocations. Invoke now stops at the first LOGISTIC.","tree":{"sha":"0fdd67d1113c0e1ee21be75a824584de634e1351","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/0fdd67d1113c0e1ee21be75a824584de634e1351"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDkxMTQ1ZDg2ZjBjMmRiMjI5NWZkNTY2YTFiNmFjZGM1NjE2NzQwMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc","sha":"0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc"}],"sha":"91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/91145d86f0c2db2295fd566a1b6acdc561674036"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:27Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"copy and state operators with trace-based parity tests\n\nAdd the kernels package with RESHAPE, CONCATENATION, STRIDED_SLICE and\nSPLIT_V ported from the TFLite reference implementations, and the state\noperators (VAR_HANDLE, READ_VARIABLE, ASSIGN_VARIABLE, CALL_ONCE) in the\nruntime. Invoke now schedules the subgraph and runs the init subgraph\nonce; Reset re-runs it. RunOperator executes a single operator for\nkernel tests. The internal/parity package reads the oracle files.\n\nRegenerate the parity oracle with a fresh interpreter per sequence:\nlitert''s reset_all_variables leaves resource variables untouched, so\nthe previous files carried state across sequences. Spec updated.","tree":{"sha":"1f4da67583fe9c9f939a054d0893c5122b8586bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/1f4da67583fe9c9f939a054d0893c5122b8586bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDBlZjlkOTZjMjhlZjkxMzYwYzgwNDhhYjkzYzA5NTM5Nzc3NzUzZGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f","sha":"971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f"}],"sha":"0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/0ef9d96c28ef91360c8048ab93c09539777753dc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:26Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"TFLite FlatBuffers bindings and validated model loader\n\nGenerate the tflite package from the TensorFlow v2.18.0 schema with flatc\n25.12.19 and add the pure Go flatbuffers runtime as the only dependency.\n\nAdd the runtime package: Load parses subgraphs, tensors (shape, dtype,\nper-channel quantization, constant buffers), operators with typed options,\nand state variables identified by VAR_HANDLE (container, shared_name).\nValidation enforces the closed operator set and versions of the spec,\nthe accepted dtypes, quantization on every int8/uint8 tensor, and the\nstructural invariants the kernels will rely on (equal quantization on\ncopy operators, per-channel filters, constant parameters). Corrupted\ninput is rejected without panicking. NewInterpreter allocates every\ndynamic tensor and variable once; Invoke and Reset return\nErrNotImplemented until the kernels land.\n\nTests load the five v2 models, cross-check tensor metadata against the\nparity oracle, reject the v1 model (naming MUL and ADD) and reject\ntruncated, random and bit-flipped files. The v1 model is added under\ntestdata/models/v1 as a negative fixture.","tree":{"sha":"603c8bc554123fa455ba3b21a7aef8de9b90bf36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/603c8bc554123fa455ba3b21a7aef8de9b90bf36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f","node_id":"C_kwDOUkeh6NoAKDk3MWYwNjFjYThjODM2NjZjMWEyMTc2MzkwNWYyMGI0N2I5NDk1N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a064396c49b0","sha":"24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a064396c49b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a064396c49b0"}],"sha":"971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/971f061ca8c83666c1a21763905f20b47b94957f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/commits/24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a064396c49b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:36:03Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T19:48:26Z","email":"tmgallice@gmail.com","name":"tgallice"},"message":"Initial project scaffold: spec, plan, oracles and golden test data\n\nPure Go wake word detector targeting microWakeWord v2 TFLite models.\nThis commit adds the technical specification, the phased implementation\nplan, the Python oracle scripts, the pinned v2 models and the generated\nparity and frontend golden vectors. Go module initialized with lint and\nMakefile targets, no code yet.","tree":{"sha":"8f4389e6d539b187b9eaedd844c5f7ec7bf6dcac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/trees/8f4389e6d539b187b9eaedd844c5f7ec7bf6dcac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tgallice/wakeword-go/git/commits/24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a064396c49b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/860533?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice","id":860533,"login":"tgallice","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MDUzMw==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tgallice","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tgallice/wakeword-go/commit/24540bed71aef030acd8a3e8b0f6a0643