ccess\" message — a\nhost has no business mounting this module for a user it already\nknows (or can check) lacks ai:chat, so the component itself now just\nrenders null instead of showing anything in that case.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b6ba8c66b9fee9761ae6c4887e7a57cde70958f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/trees/5b6ba8c66b9fee9761ae6c4887e7a57cde70958f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/commits/9eabdef0db0f1f78b67aa75b985ed19fd484d81d","verification":{"payload":"tree 5b6ba8c66b9fee9761ae6c4887e7a57cde70958f\nparent 34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1790567613 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790567613 -0300\n\nfeat(chat): render nothing without a valid ai:chat token (#2)\n\nDrop the local-only demo fallback and the \"no access\" message — a\nhost has no business mounting this module for a user it already\nknows (or can check) lacks ai:chat, so the component itself now just\nrenders null instead of showing anything in that case.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqueS9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0xoQAECjDKjstY4m/a+nlXkJg5Hj\nirb9kIcNkO8s4nFt6wFt7uckNsqk8HU1VHEkwDPyzpYgg9XPTviH8G6/O+/5cx2E\nYWrvtufHVPuuVcdIOGvJCvsVdvxCdMYPXnwa6mJhyYAYvVVQt+ICVH/oCQID+u9b\nKNv8E+ReW9GTHNsT8TKwBA6HN15zS05Xvr0ZQjJtrdnEwtlJwO082bcOndaVm1nB\n6cPek3Yicct6dUzAgjlTootPxZhHSdzg21h2pr5eQafCPV/V3/VEIijn2N20hgag\nTS4TdabmsxBXroRU7yP8EMGLxyDUFwqnt2hH9C+dxVyGQJteZxg0F7ySt2HgkRGp\n74RnouV6+8oa/8jR3ySQVs1EZLUW2FTjyEr6KHM1i4KdmaDva4AyM4QYt+K0Yb6R\nxUi6h2HILhNQeh5XD8riAsoCQz8pU5j54vnbG5Q5ZGMchcCwjVMsOl8oy9KwAx8M\nHVVaDItVAi3BpN3CCgNiqOE2VCIitWTqHMuRDieUbAJIJXvF28IDi0yVxs5QA8Ms\noThZywGfSsChNqrYoHjFZjwmGbAVCsX3Q4GvBo3+WmqGki2xJIUP72+JLYszPalW\nUK4C613ecDvUUsnnBVUdow7b1uk1MDfFcOOHKiGdZD7ehbVrJf3yZhNvV9C0XkGI\nHKLo85nnWlSzwYlBFhsK\n=SPU9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T03:53:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commit/9eabdef0db0f1f78b67aa75b985ed19fd484d81d","node_id":"C_kwDOUlBYatoAKDllYWJkZWYwZGIwZjFmNzhiNjdhYTc1Yjk4NWVkMTlmZDQ4NGQ4MWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commit/34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f","sha":"34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f"}],"sha":"9eabdef0db0f1f78b67aa75b985ed19fd484d81d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/9eabdef0db0f1f78b67aa75b985ed19fd484d81d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22185362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv","id":22185362,"login":"IanOliv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTg1MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:33:52Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T02:33:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(chat): consume wrapper-api sessions and messages (#1)\n\n* feat(chat): consume wrapper-api sessions and messages\n\nChat now talks to wrapper-api''s ai worker for real instead of only\never having the local-only seeded conversation:\n\n- src/api/{client,types}.ts: listSessions, createSession, listMessages,\n  sendMessage against dev-ai.0xhackerspace.workers.dev (VITE_AI_API_URL,\n  never hardcoded). Handles the ai worker''s OpenAI-style nested error\n  shape ({ error: { message, type } }), different from auth/api''s flat\n  { error: \"...\" }.\n- ExposedChat/Item gain a `token` prop, same reasoning as theme/\n  userProfile — a plain prop across the federation boundary, not a\n  shared store. Without one (e.g. the standalone dev harness), Chat\n  keeps working exactly as before: the local-only seeded conversation.\n- New \"view sessions\" functionality: src/Chat/SessionPicker.tsx, a\n  compact header-row picker (not a full sidebar — this is embedded in\n  a host''s content area). Lists the signed-in user''s sessions, lets\n  them switch or start a new one; sending a message with none selected\n  yet creates one lazily first.\n- A permission error (no ai:chat) surfaces as an inline message\n  instead of crashing, same pattern as wrapper''s Profile page.\n\nBug found and fixed by the new tests before it ever hit a browser:\ncreating a session inside send() also fired the \"load this session''s\nmessages\" effect, which raced the just-appended optimistic message and\nsometimes clobbered it with the (still-empty) server state. Fixed with\na ref flag that skips that reload exactly once, right after this\ncomponent creates a session itself.\n\nVerified for real end-to-end: registered/logged in as an existing\nwrapper-api user, sent a message from a fresh session, and got back a\nreal Workers AI reply — not mocked. wrapper-api''s ai worker needed the\nsame CORS fix already applied to auth/api (0xHackerSpace/wrapper-api#17).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\n* feat(chat): gate access on the ai:chat permission in the token\n\nDecode the token''s own payload client-side and check for ai:chat\nbefore rendering the composer or calling wrapper-api at all, instead\nof only reacting to a 403 after the fact. A user without it sees an\nexplanatory message; the ai worker still re-validates every request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"250f1df6330582c921b39ed03e27ad32e8aed14b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/trees/250f1df6330582c921b39ed03e27ad32e8aed14b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/commits/34ebc366f8ffa04d7b472c57179d73ba02b41d5f","verification":{"payload":"tree 250f1df6330582c921b39ed03e27ad32e8aed14b\nparent 2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c\nauthor Ian Gabriel Oliveira de Sousa <22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com> 1790562832 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790562832 -0300\n\nfeat(chat): consume wrapper-api sessions and messages (#1)\n\n* feat(chat): consume wrapper-api sessions and messages\n\nChat now talks to wrapper-api''s ai worker for real instead of only\never having the local-only seeded conversation:\n\n- src/api/{client,types}.ts: listSessions, createSession, listMessages,\n  sendMessage against dev-ai.0xhackerspace.workers.dev (VITE_AI_API_URL,\n  never hardcoded). Handles the ai worker''s OpenAI-style nested error\n  shape ({ error: { message, type } }), different from auth/api''s flat\n  { error: \"...\" }.\n- ExposedChat/Item gain a `token` prop, same reasoning as theme/\n  userProfile — a plain prop across the federation boundary, not a\n  shared store. Without one (e.g. the standalone dev harness), Chat\n  keeps working exactly as before: the local-only seeded conversation.\n- New \"view sessions\" functionality: src/Chat/SessionPicker.tsx, a\n  compact header-row picker (not a full sidebar — this is embedded in\n  a host''s content area). Lists the signed-in user''s sessions, lets\n  them switch or start a new one; sending a message with none selected\n  yet creates one lazily first.\n- A permission error (no ai:chat) surfaces as an inline message\n  instead of crashing, same pattern as wrapper''s Profile page.\n\nBug found and fixed by the new tests before it ever hit a browser:\ncreating a session inside send() also fired the \"load this session''s\nmessages\" effect, which raced the just-appended optimistic message and\nsometimes clobbered it with the (still-empty) server state. Fixed with\na ref flag that skips that reload exactly once, right after this\ncomponent creates a session itself.\n\nVerified for real end-to-end: registered/logged in as an existing\nwrapper-api user, sent a message from a fresh session, and got back a\nreal Workers AI reply — not mocked. wrapper-api''s ai worker needed the\nsame CORS fix already applied to auth/api (0xHackerSpace/wrapper-api#17).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\n* feat(chat): gate access on the ai:chat permission in the token\n\nDecode the token''s own payload client-side and check for ai:chat\nbefore rendering the composer or calling wrapper-api at all, instead\nof only reacting to a 403 after the fact. A user without it sees an\nexplanatory message; the ai worker still re-validates every request.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqudIQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVmgQAGZ3YjLG8uMvLHNrTyTQec8P\nE+QZZzGVwEONgZaoFgS25x/tw8HBbL/7K3c89p4Rhf94Q+ijVDQOMnCy68ZBw15H\nZGzkNMYMtLqxSR7tiqSN/lUSyERhYFjeJexaBEk5tgK7JreMbxW9XqVIdrKisdX/\nPQcC9nW0qBSEQjFRnGfcaH26T8KfpVas+6huvJTzh38DShueWv4MiEd4rRYX1vjt\n9YcBTUxcrMdHDnmkYmj4Df19oGJVjFT0FYOqkY3VsfUJT5cTKcIdJpG9GGo2/GHn\ngqIbv1mo6QvCJEXFtfGezJoxm7YuS9orYhLIa/2nwq2jYi8+YFYF9GV6fh2UOoqQ\nUwqfPrB7LwBYEM0kOoMsxaDvshgbbZJ/UdkocmypUGcT9Qtfcy7NGjFw6+EQKLkQ\nX2h5PNWlIfmQ56MQwbdZXpjZrD6JLXhi0k9s0WbMeGa/13Sp8ZYrKhQZC2JNPL+v\niAGhCoMdd8US5h1up/zfRURFpu8OG375dam6wXzDAPqdN34hwfdRj2oNEQGUoa0/\nlkFNqAUumgfhi8hRDJolPiP9a18rSiuX1ChzZhdziZ25h2IRSJzkbxaGFatk/r5/\nEWJJrMKHkzLUGLB5dfNkazFa20CgifJK9dskKCuaWYCkQmYSEJHSQCvDQxoJWOEy\nedKBCxlfPM2Q2V1XLoBq\n=b/O+\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-28T02:33:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://a