iv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTg1MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:07:05Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"IanOliv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T08:07:05Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"IanOliv"},"message":"fix(deploy): add s-maxage=0 so Vercel''s CDN actually revalidates remoteEntry.js\n\nmax-age=0 alone only governs browser/shared-cache fallback behavior — without\ns-maxage, Vercel''s edge CDN kept serving a stale remoteEntry.js for hours\nafter a new deployment went live (observed directly: the aliased domain\nserved 3+-hour-old content while the deployment''s own unaliased URL already\nhad the new build).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH","tree":{"sha":"6c4be0a6ecd8220345d00739223dcce855fa6de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/trees/6c4be0a6ecd8220345d00739223dcce855fa6de8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/commits/2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22185362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv","id":22185362,"login":"IanOliv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTg1MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commit/2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c","node_id":"C_kwDOUlBYatoAKDI3MDMwMjliNzI3OTYxM2YyYmU5NDJjNzgyNDc2NzIwNmU5M2E5OWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commit/3085d21f4a47ab50153bc99cc89af943386d6d93","sha":"3085d21f4a47ab50153bc99cc89af943386d6d93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/3085d21f4a47ab50153bc99cc89af943386d6d93"}],"sha":"2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/2703029b7279613f2be942c7824767206e93a99c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22185362?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/IanOliv","id":22185362,"login":"IanOliv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMTg1MzYy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/IanOliv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/commits/3085d21f4a47ab50153bc99cc89af943386d6d93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:31:16Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"IanOliv"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T07:31:16Z","email":"22185362+IanOliv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"IanOliv"},"message":"feat: set up Chat as a standalone Module Federation remote\n\nPorts the Chat component and its federation config from a working\nprototype (IanOliv/wrapper''s apps/chat-remote, container name\nchat_remote, exposed as ./Chat), giving it its own repo built on the\ningredient template''s component-template app instead of living inside\na host''s monorepo.\n\nOnly react/react-dom are shared as federation singletons — MUI,\nemotion and Recoil are deliberately not, per findings already recorded\nin ingredient''s ADR 0001. Theme and user profile data cross the\nfederation boundary as plain props instead.\n\nIncludes unit tests (Vitest + Testing Library, with a jsdom\nscrollIntoView stub) and Playwright e2e tests covering the standalone\nharness and remoteEntry.js''s CORS headers, verified against both the\ndev server and a production build.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KYsKPc4CJuydwcdkCUPBdH","tree":{"sha":"4f5aea8f79ce38b1daea8c54de072b1cde408945","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/trees/4f5aea8f79ce38b1daea8c54de072b1cde408945"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/0xHackerSpace/ingredient-chat/git/commits/3085d21f4a47ab50153bc99cc89a