e419842340cfcd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:28:15Z","email":"unknownloop11@gmail.com","name":"Matthew R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:28:15Z","email":"unknownloop11@gmail.com","name":"Matthew R"},"message":"feat: initialize checkout and products zones with basic structure and components\n\n- Added robots.txt files for both checkout and products zones to allow all user agents.\n- Implemented error boundary component for handling errors in checkout and products zones.\n- Created global CSS files for styling in both zones, integrating Tailwind CSS and custom theme.\n- Developed layout components for both zones, including metadata setup and font integration.\n- Added loading and not found components for better user experience in both zones.\n- Implemented page components for checkout and products zones, displaying app names.\n- Created string resources for localization in both zones.\n- Set up environment configuration for both zones using zod for validation.\n- Developed proxy middleware for handling security headers and correlation IDs.\n- Configured TypeScript and Vitest for testing in both zones.\n- Removed obsolete ESLint configurations and strings from the home zone.\n- Added example .env files for products and shell zones with necessary environment variables.\n- Updated shell zone to handle rewrites for downstream zone proxies.","tree":{"sha":"3139a8df0fb98b4783210b55002fb585acb6c866","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matthew110703/timmbr-storefront/git/trees/3139a8df0fb98b4783210b55002fb585acb6c866"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/matthew110703/timmbr-storefront/git/commits/6e88295d472ae99970e1f723f7e419842340cfcd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140831930?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matthew110703/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github